  2. Ver logs completos:  journalctl -u lab-broken-service.service -n 50
  3. Ver logs de boot:    journalctl -u lab-broken-service.service -b
  4. Ver el unit file:    systemctl cat lab-broken-service.service
  5. Verificar sintaxis:  systemd-analyze verify lab-broken-service.service

